  "title": "Asian Veggie Packets",
  "description": "Carrots, snow peas, mushrooms and scallions with fresh ginger and sesame seeds are drizzled with a sweet and sour sauce, wrapped in foil packets, and baked until veggies are just tender.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
